WEBVTT

NOTE
The homepage film carries no spoken narration. These cues are the on-screen narration line,
at the seconds it appears, so the film is readable by a screen reader and searchable as text.

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:07.600
Proving it, notice by notice, is what there is never time for.

2
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:17.000
It reads what you give it, records what a document states, and claims nothing beyond it.

3
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:20.400
Everything here stands on a named project, attributed to you.

4
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:22.000
What is missing is named, not filled in.

5
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.600
Then the federal market is measured against that record.

6
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:30.600
It ranks what it has read, and says what it has not.

7
00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:38.400
The reason is traceable: shared scope, a named project, your own words.

8
00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.000
What works against you is stated just as plainly.

9
00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:52.200
It drafts only what your record supports.

10
00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.200
It asks for your business size rather than assuming it.

11
00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.200
It never sends. You do.

12
00:01:02.400 --> 00:01:04.800
Every pursuit stays one record, until it closes.
